 1→{% comment %}
 2→  Zip Code Checker — App Embed Block
 3→  This block controls whether the Zip Code Checker app is active in this theme.
 4→  Enable or disable it from Theme Editor > App Embeds.
 5→  When enabled, it sets window.__zccAppEnabled = true so all widget blocks
 6→  on the page know the app is active and should render.
 7→{% endcomment %}
 8→<script>window.__zccAppEnabled = true;</script>
